# Lazy evaluation: chained $map operations remain lazy
# Three maps, only access one key - none of the intermediate errors should fire
[map [fn [let x] [+ x 100]]
  [map [fn [let y] [+ y 10]]
    [map [fn [let z] [+ z 1]]
      [a: 1  b: [raise "map chain should not force"]]]]]
---
%.a
=== out
Int(112)
